{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794352025268,"sessionID":"ses_e3865d475ffeWX1dsogsfu9qqZ","part":{"id":"prt_1c7b70e4f00118sd01q5xaP9iN","messageID":"msg_1c7b5fcb4001KoZCroymItvouj","sessionID":"ses_e3865d475ffeWX1dsogsfu9qqZ","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794352025269,"sessionID":"ses_e3865d475ffeWX1dsogsfu9qqZ","part":{"id":"prt_1c7b70e61001gjh5q23pZZGMEG","messageID":"msg_1c7b5fcb4001KoZCroymItvouj","sessionID":"ses_e3865d475ffeWX1dsogsfu9qqZ","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a warehouse inventory app (Flask JSON API under `/api` + React/TS/Tailwind frontend) per the spec: items CRUD, stock movements, low-stock flagging, token auth, SQLite under `./data`, served by gunicorn on port 8000 from the root `Dockerfile`.\n\n## Important Details\n- Stack: Flask 3.1.3 + gunicorn 26.2.0 (pinned in `backend/requirements.txt` / `requirements.lock` — no new Python deps needed; hashing via `werkzeug.security`); React 19 + Vite 8 + Tailwind v4 via `@tailwindcss/vite`, CSS entry is only `frontend/src/index.css` (`@import \"tailwindcss\";`).\n- Auth: Bearer tokens in `auth_tokens` table (multiple tokens per user allowed); register→201, login→200 `{\"token\":...}`, missing/invalid token→401 on mutations.\n- Error shape: `{\"error\": \"<msg>\", \"errors\": {\"field\": \"msg\"}}`, all validation errors return 400 (including duplicate sku → `\"SKU already exists\"`); duplicate username → 400 `\"Username already exists\"`.\n- Decisions: item creation does NOT create an opening movement; PUT tolerates missing fields (keeps existing, never touches `quantity`); `GET /api/items/{id}/movements` always 200 `{\"items\":[...]}` (empty even for deleted/missing items); `GET /api/items/{id}` 404; DELETE returns 200 `{\"ok\": true}`; movement POST returns 201 movement object; `low_stock` param parses `\"\"/\"1\"/\"true\"/\"yes\"/\"on\"` as true; `location` filter is case-insensitive exact match; `q` matches name/sku/location; page default 1, page_size default 20 (invalid→default, no upper cap); sorted by `name COLLATE NOCASE`.\n- Movement below 0 → 400 `\"Insufficient stock: only N available\"`, changes nothing; delta must be non-zero integer.\n- Frontend routing is hand-rolled in `src/router.tsx` (`navigate()` + `navigation`/`popstate` events, `<Link>`); token/username in localStorage keys `inventory_token` / `inventory_username`; `session-changed` event syncs App state; 401 in `apiFetch` calls `clearSession()`.\n- No Docker in sandbox — verify with local gunicorn instead; `.dockerignore` ignores `**/.venv`, `node_modules`, `frontend/dist`, `data/*.db`.\n- Sandbox permissions: `/tmp/opencode/*` effectively unusable (tool denied) → venv lives at `/workspace/.venv`; work only inside `/workspace`.\n- Test DB must be reset between test runs (`kill $(cat .gunicorn.pid); rm -rf data; restart gunicorn`) since data persists.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- `backend/app.py` fully written: schema (users, auth_tokens, items, movements), WAL init at import, all endpoints (health, register/login, items CRUD+list with q/location/low_stock/page/page_size, movements list/post), JSON 404/405/500 handlers, SPA catch-all excluding `api` paths. `/api/health` was accidentally dropped then restored.\n- API test suite `/workspace/.api_test.py` passes: `ALL TESTS PASSED` (auth, 401s, CRUD, filters, paging, movements, insufficient stock, duplicate sku, delete cascades).\n- Frontend scaffolding: `vite.config.ts` (tailwindcss plugin), `tsconfig.json`, `src/index.css`, `index.html` title \"Warehouse Inventory\"; deps installed & pinned: tailwindcss/@tailwindcss/vite 4.3.5, typescript 5.9.3, @types/react(-dom) 19.3.0; `typecheck` script added.\n- Frontend source written: `src/api.ts` (types, ApiError, apiFetch, api client), `src/router.tsx`, `src/App.tsx` (route parsing, session state), `src/components/Header.tsx`, `src/pages/{AuthPage,InventoryPage,ItemDetailPage,ItemFormPage}.tsx`.\n- `npx tsc --noEmit` clean; `npm run build` succeeds (dist/index.html, assets 17KB css, 247KB js).\n- Backend verified serving frontend: `/` 200 html, assets 200, SPA fallback `/items/1` 200, `/api/nothing` → `{\"error\":\"Not found\"}`.\n- jsdom installed `--no-save` (not in package.json/lock); smoke entry `src/smoke-entry.tsx` bundled via `npx vite build --ssr src/smoke-entry.tsx --outDir .smoke --emptyOutDir` → `.smoke/smoke-entry.js`.\n\n### Active\n- Writing `/workspace/frontend/.smoke/run.mjs` — the last `write` truncated mid-file at `clickButton(\"\") // placeholder replaced below`; the file is incomplete and must be rewritten.\n- Known fixes already identified for the rewrite: seed all 3 items (Alpha/Zebra/Beta) in API setup before mount (paging math: page_size 2 → \"Page 1 of 2\" shows Alpha+Beta, Zebra absent, Next → \"Page 2 of 2\"); capture new item id from `window.location.pathname` after create (Gamma=4 since Beta=3), use it for `/items/{id}/edit`; use `submitVia(\"Add item\"/\"Take out\"/\"Receive\"/\"Save changes\")` instead of `form:last-of-type`; quantity assertions via `quantityShown()` (`main .text-3xl` textContent, expect `\"10instock\"`); drop the `go(\"/login\")`-while-signed-in remount dance and the placeholder `clickButton(\"\")`/`click(\"main button:not([role=switch])\")` lines; wrap global assignment in try/catch (read-only `navigator`).\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Next Move\n1. Rewrite `/workspace/frontend/.smoke/run.mjs` completely with the fixes listed in Active (jsdom setup, API seed of 3 items, mount, list/search/low-stock/location/paging assertions, add-form duplicate-sku → `SKU already exists`, receive/take-out incl. insufficient-stock, edit duplicate-sku, delete confirmation (`window.confirm` false then true), sign-out, signed-out guard, login form, no-serious-React-errors check, print `SMOKE OK`).\n2. Reset DB and run end-to-end: `cd /workspace && kill $(cat .gunicorn.pid); sleep 1; rm -rf data && (.venv/bin/gunicorn --bind 127.0.0.1:8000 --pythonpath backend app:app --daemon --pid .gunicorn.pid --error-logfile .gunicorn.log) && sleep 2 && .venv/bin/python .api_test.py && cd frontend && node .smoke/run.mjs` — then clean up `.gunicorn.pid/.gunicorn.log`, `.api_test.py`, `src/smoke-entry.tsx`, `.smoke/` (keep `.venv`, dist), and confirm `npm run typecheck` + `npm run build` still pass.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: complete Flask API + static hosting; health at `/api/health`; DATA_DIR from env `data` (cwd-relative).\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/api.ts`: types (`Item`, `Movement`, `ItemsPage`), `ApiError`, `apiFetch`, `api` client, session storage helpers.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx`: route parsing (`/`, `/login`, `/register`, `/items/new`, `/items/{id}`, `/items/{id}/edit`), session sync listeners.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/pages/InventoryPage.tsx`: search (`#search`, 250ms debounce), location select (`#location`), low-stock switch (`button[role=\"switch\"]`), paging (`#page-size`, Previous/Next), amber `bg-amber-100` low rows, delete with `window.confirm`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/pages/ItemDetailPage.tsx`: Receive/Take out forms (ids `receive-qty`/`receive-reason`/`take-qty`/`take-reason`), movements table, `main .text-3xl` quantity display.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/pages/ItemFormPage.tsx`: add/edit form (ids `name`, `sku`, `item-location`, `reorder`, `quantity`), API validation display, signed-out guard (\"Sign in required\").\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/pages/AuthPage.tsx`: login/register, auto-login after register, redirect when signed in.\n- `/workspace/.api_test.py`: passing API regression suite (needs fresh DB each run).\n- `/workspace/frontend/.smoke/run.mjs`: incomplete jsdom smoke test (currently truncated).\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/smoke-entry.tsx`: temporary SSR smoke entry (delete after testing).\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`, `/workspace/README.md`: build/run contract (port 8000, `npm ci`, pip constraints lock, `data/`).","time":{"start":1794352025185,"end":1794352025193}}}
